WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.939
LeLibrary for Jellyfin: your debrid library, inside the player you already use.

2
00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:14.070
It reads the library LeLibrary already built: the same titles, the same names, the same posters.

3
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:20.171
Four steps: add the repository, install, paste your link and key, then sync.

4
00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.833
The only thing you type is your own key. The link comes from your LeLibrary setup page.

5
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:38.183
Thirty nine thousand items in about two minutes. No file scan, nothing downloaded.

6
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:47.461
Every play mints a fresh link, so a URL that reaches a player cannot be reused later.

7
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:57.231
TorBox is supported today. Real-Debrid, AllDebrid and Premiumize follow, and it is Jellyfin twelve only.

8
00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:01.446
LeLibrary for Jellyfin. Free, open source, and yours.

